# PropertyTrail Terms of Service

Effective 2026-11-23 — version 1.0-2026-11-23

## 1. About these terms

These terms govern your use of PropertyTrail, a property condition, inspection, inventory, maintenance and evidence management service operated by Zekini. By creating an account you agree to them. If you use PropertyTrail on behalf of an organisation, you confirm that you may bind that organisation.

## 2. Your account

You must give accurate registration details and keep your password confidential. Tell us promptly if you suspect unauthorised use of your account. You are responsible for activity carried out with your credentials.

## 3. Your content

You keep ownership of the property records, photographs and other material you upload. You give us a limited licence to store, process and display that material only to provide and support the service. Do not upload material you have no right to share, or content that is unlawful or infringes someone else's rights.

## 4. Acceptable use

Use the service lawfully and do not attempt to disrupt it, access other users' data, bypass access controls or overload our systems. We may suspend an account that is used in breach of these terms.

## 5. Availability and changes

We aim to keep the service available but do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation. We may change or improve the service and will publish a new version of these terms when the terms change; the version recorded against your account identifies the text you agreed to.

## 6. Privacy

We process personal information in line with applicable South African law, including POPIA. See our privacy notice for what we collect, why we collect it and your choices.

## 7. Liability

The service is provided as-is to the extent permitted by law. We are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for loss arising from data you chose not to back up. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.

## 8. Contact

Questions about these terms can be sent to Zekini through the contact details published on our website.
